§ `s 217 Voting rights of fiduciaries, pledgors and joint owners of stock`

§§ `s 217(a) Fiduciaries and pledgors`

-- Persons holding stock in a fiduciary capacity are entitled to vote the shares so held. Persons whose stock is pledged are
-- entitled to vote, unless in the transfer by the pledgor on the books of the corporation the pledgor has expressly empowered
-- the pledgee to vote, in which case only the pledgee, or the pledgee's proxy, may represent the stock and vote on it.
-- src:821 | (a) Persons holding stock in a fiduciary capacity shall be entitled to vote the shares so held. Persons whose stock is pledged shall be entitled to vote, unless in the transfer by the pledgor on the books of the corporation such person has expressly empowered the pledgee to vote thereon, in which case only the pledgee, or such pledgee’s proxy, may represent such stock and vote thereon.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 217(a) (src:821)
DECLARE `s 217(a) Capacity in which the person would vote the shares` IS ONE OF
    `as a person holding the stock in a fiduciary capacity`
    `as a person whose stock is pledged`
    `as the pledgee of the stock, or the pledgee's proxy`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 217(a) (src:821)
GIVEN capacity IS A `s 217(a) Capacity in which the person would vote the shares`
      `in the transfer on the books of the corporation the pledgor expressly empowered the pledgee to vote the stock` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 217(a) the person is entitled to vote the shares` capacity `in the transfer on the books of the corporation the pledgor expressly empowered the pledgee to vote the stock` MEANS
    CONSIDER capacity
    WHEN `as a person holding the stock in a fiduciary capacity` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `as a person whose stock is pledged` THEN NOT `in the transfer on the books of the corporation the pledgor expressly empowered the pledgee to vote the stock`
    WHEN `as the pledgee of the stock, or the pledgee's proxy` THEN `in the transfer on the books of the corporation the pledgor expressly empowered the pledgee to vote the stock`

§§ `s 217(b) Shares standing in the names of two or more persons`

-- If shares or other securities having voting power stand of record in the names of 2 or more persons (fiduciaries, partners,
-- joint tenants, tenants in common, tenants by the entirety or otherwise), or 2 or more persons have the same fiduciary
-- relationship respecting the same shares, then, unless the secretary of the corporation is given written notice to the
-- contrary and is furnished with a copy of the instrument or order appointing them or creating the relationship wherein it is
-- so provided, their acts with respect to voting have this effect: (1) if only 1 votes, that person's act binds all; (2) if more
-- than 1 vote, the act of the majority so voting binds all; (3) if more than 1 vote and the vote is evenly split on a particular
-- matter, each faction may vote the securities proportionally, or any person voting the shares, or a beneficiary, if any, may
-- apply to the Court of Chancery or another court with jurisdiction to appoint an additional person to act with the persons so
-- voting, and the shares are then voted as determined by a majority of those persons and the person appointed. If the instrument
-- shows that a tenancy is held in unequal interests, a majority or an even split is a majority or an even split in interest.
-- src:822 | (b) If shares or other securities having voting power stand of record in the names of 2 or more persons, whether fiduciaries, members of a partnership, joint tenants, tenants in common, tenants by the entirety or otherwise, or if 2 or more persons have the same fiduciary relationship respecting the same shares, unless the secretary of the corporation is given written notice to the contrary and is furnished with a copy of the instrument or order appointing them or creating the relationship wherein it is so provided, their acts with respect to voting shall have the following effect:
-- src:823 | (1) If only 1 votes, such person’s act binds all;
-- src:824 | (2) If more than 1 vote, the act of the majority so voting binds all;
-- src:825 | (3) If more than 1 vote, but the vote is evenly split on any particular matter, each faction may vote the securities in question proportionally, or any person voting the shares, or a beneficiary, if any, may apply to the Court of Chancery or such other court as may have jurisdiction to appoint an additional person to act with the persons so voting the shares, which shall then be voted as determined by a majority of such persons and the person appointed by the Court. If the instrument so filed shows that any such tenancy is held in unequal interests, a majority or even split for the purpose of this subsection shall be a majority or even split in interest.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 217(b) (src:822-825)
DECLARE `s 217(b) Effect of the voting of persons in whose names the shares stand` IS ONE OF
    `the act of the only person who votes binds all`
    `the act of the majority so voting binds all`
    `the vote is evenly split and each faction may vote the securities proportionally, or a person voting or a beneficiary may apply to appoint an additional person`
    `the written notice to the contrary and the instrument or order it is furnished with govern instead`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 217(b) (src:822-825)
GIVEN `the secretary of the corporation was given written notice to the contrary and furnished with a copy of the instrument or order appointing them or creating the relationship wherein it is so provided` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the instrument filed shows that the tenancy is held in unequal interests` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the number of the persons who vote` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of those persons who vote one way` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of those persons who vote the other way` IS A NUMBER
      `the interest of those who vote one way` IS A NUMBER
      `the interest of those who vote the other way` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `s 217(b) Effect of the voting of persons in whose names the shares stand`
`s 217(b) the effect of the voting of the persons in whose names the shares stand` `the secretary of the corporation was given written notice to the contrary and furnished with a copy of the instrument or order appointing them or creating the relationship wherein it is so provided` `the instrument filed shows that the tenancy is held in unequal interests` `the number of the persons who vote` `the number of those persons who vote one way` `the number of those persons who vote the other way` `the interest of those who vote one way` `the interest of those who vote the other way` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the secretary of the corporation was given written notice to the contrary and furnished with a copy of the instrument or order appointing them or creating the relationship wherein it is so provided`
            THEN JUST `the written notice to the contrary and the instrument or order it is furnished with govern instead`
        IF `the number of the persons who vote` AT MOST 0 THEN NOTHING
        IF `the number of the persons who vote` EQUALS 1 THEN JUST `the act of the only person who votes binds all`
        IF `the weight of those who vote one way` EQUALS `the weight of those who vote the other way`
            THEN JUST `the vote is evenly split and each faction may vote the securities proportionally, or a person voting or a beneficiary may apply to appoint an additional person`
        OTHERWISE JUST `the act of the majority so voting binds all`
    WHERE
        `the weight of those who vote one way` MEANS
            IF `the instrument filed shows that the tenancy is held in unequal interests`
            THEN `the interest of those who vote one way`
            ELSE `the number of those persons who vote one way`
        `the weight of those who vote the other way` MEANS
            IF `the instrument filed shows that the tenancy is held in unequal interests`
            THEN `the interest of those who vote the other way`
            ELSE `the number of those persons who vote the other way`

